      "content": "hey, i just got the worst headache of my entire life out of nowhere. like it hit me like a bolt of lightning. i get migraines sometimes but this is way different, it's just so intense. do u think it's just a really bad migraine flare up? i really don't want to go to the er if i don't have to, it's so expensive and i'm pretty sure i can just sleep it off with some ibuprofen.",
