      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feels like i've had this exact sensation before during a bad migraine. it just peaked really fast. i feel a bit nauseous but i think i can just take a bunch of advil and lie down in a dark room for a bit. if i just take a higher dose of ibuprofen like 800mg or something, do u think that'll help knock it out so i don't have to deal with the hospital?",
